    "$comment": "Zod is authoritative. Also enforce calendar validity, timezone/units, coverage/null semantics, consent, unique IDs, matching request/mode/draft and revision versions, phase continuity, allowed future dates/identities and schedule constraints. Recheck live ownership, versions and locks before approval; schema validity does not approve or publish."
